<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-ANZ joins rush of banks to Internet.</title>
<headline>RTRS-ANZ joins rush of banks to Internet.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Australia and New Zealand Banking Group Ltd on Thursday joined the rush of banks to the Internet by launching a web site on the global computer network.</p>
<p>The interactive site offers personal finance applications, such as a budget planner and mortgage repayment calculator, and will be continually updated and enhanced, the bank said.</p>
<p>&quot;The services that we are now providing through the Internet provide a solid platform for future initiatives such as PC banking...,&quot; ANZ said.</p>
<p>-- Melbourne Bureau 613-9286-1421</p>
